  "prefLabel": "Plc 207.14 Changing Electronic Access Information for an Oral Public Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 207.14 Changing Electronic Access Information for an Oral Public Hearing.\n\n(a) The electronic access information for a hybrid or virtual hearing to receive comments on rules proposed by the executive director shall not be changed except in accordance with RSA 541-A:11, V-a.\n\n(b) The electronic access information for a hybrid hearing to receive comments on rules proposed by a policy-autonomous board shall not be changed except in accordance with RSA 541-A:11, V-a.\n\nSource. #13837, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc100-200.html"
